sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S4 as S4 Becas
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant S6 as S6 Proyector
  participant Mongo as MongoDB read store
  participant UI as Panel React
  S4->>PG: Guardar Beca + RegistroDecision + Outbox
  PG-->>S4: Commit
  S4->>MQ: Publicar evento desde Outbox
  MQ-->>S6: BecaRevocada.v1 (al menos una vez)
  S6->>Mongo: Idempotencia por eventId + upsert
  S6-->>MQ: Ack solo tras persistir
  S6-->>UI: SignalR aviso de cambio
  UI->>S6: GET /api/v1/indicadores
  S6-->>UI: Proyección + actualizadoEn
